There is no auth.json to read the ChatGPT sign-in from. Codex may keep it in the system keychain, which only Codex can read.
  Let recite ask Codex instead:
      recite --auth-source codex auth status
  or sign in with Codex:
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home '/opt/codex tools/bin/codex' login
More help: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/auth
